#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:2
msgid "Run subagents in the background"
msgstr "在后台运行子智能体"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:4
msgid "Start a child agent without waiting for it, keep the parent working, and read the report when it is ready. Tool restrictions on a child are not an operating-system sandbox."
msgstr "启动一个子智能体而不等待它，让父智能体继续工作，等报告准备好后再读取。对子智能体的工具限制并不是操作系统层面的沙箱。"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:9
msgid "Run it"
msgstr "运行示例"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:11
msgid "From the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录执行："

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:17
msgid "The output includes:"
msgstr "输出包含："

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:23
msgid "This program uses deterministic offline models. It requires no API key and is executed by the documentation test suite."
msgstr "这个程序使用确定性的离线模型，不需要 API 密钥，并由文档测试套件执行。"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:27
msgid "How the model manages a task"
msgstr "模型如何管理任务"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:29
msgid ":class:`~zett_agent.extensions.async_subagent.AsyncSubAgentExtension` registers five tools:"
msgstr ":class:`~zett_agent.extensions.async_subagent.AsyncSubAgentExtension` 会注册五个工具："

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:36
msgid "Tool"
msgstr "工具"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:37
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:38
msgid "``task_start``"
msgstr "``task_start``"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:39
msgid "Start a task from a configured profile; returns its ``task_id`` at once."
msgstr "用已配置的子智能体配置启动一个任务，并立即返回它的 ``task_id``\\ 。"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:40
msgid "``task_list``"
msgstr "``task_list``"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:41
msgid "Show every task of the session with its status."
msgstr "列出本会话的所有任务及其状态。"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:42
msgid "``task_status``"
msgstr "``task_status``"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:43
msgid "Show one task without its report; never waits."
msgstr "查看单个任务的状态，不含报告；从不等待。"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:44
msgid "``task_output``"
msgstr "``task_output``"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:45
msgid "Return the report, waiting up to ``wait_seconds`` when asked."
msgstr "返回报告；需要时最多等待 ``wait_seconds`` 秒。"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:46
msgid "``task_cancel``"
msgstr "``task_cancel``"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:47
msgid "Stop a running task."
msgstr "停止一个正在运行的任务。"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:49
msgid "A finished task is announced before the parent's next model call, or when the session's next request starts, as an ordinary agent message. A task whose result the model already read is not announced again."
msgstr "任务结束后，会在父智能体下一次调用模型之前，或会话的下一个请求开始时，以普通智能体消息的形式通知它。模型已经读取过结果的任务不会再次通知。"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:58
msgid "Customize it by subclassing"
msgstr "通过子类化来定制"

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:60
msgid "Override only what you need instead of copying the extension:"
msgstr "只重写你需要的部分，而不是复制整个扩展："

#: ../../examples/async-subagent.rst:75
msgid "``task_info`` shapes what each tool returns, ``task_started`` and ``task_finished`` observe the lifecycle (their errors are logged, never raised into the task), and ``_create_child`` changes how each child agent is built. Tasks live in memory for the lifetime of the extension object and are visible only to the session that started them. Call ``await extension.close()`` when the application shuts down."
msgstr "``task_info`` 决定每个工具返回的内容，``task_started`` 和 ``task_finished`` 用来观察生命周期（它们的错误只会被记录，不会抛进任务里），``_create_child`` 则改变每个子智能体的构建方式。任务在扩展对象的生命周期内保存在内存中，并且只对启动它们的会话可见。应用关闭时请调用 ``await extension.close()``\\ 。"

